#. module: chatgpt_api_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:chatgpt_api_connector.field_res_config_settings__chatgpt_model
msgid ""
"Select the ChatGPT model to use for queries.\n"
"• GPT-3.5 Turbo: balanced option in cost and performance, suitable for most use cases.\n"
"• GPT-3.5 Turbo 16k: allows handling much longer input/output texts.\n"
"• GPT-4: more advanced model, offers better results in complex tasks, but with higher cost and possibly stricter usage limits.\n"
"• GPT-4 Turbo Preview: most updated and efficient version of GPT-4, recommended if available in your account.\n"
"Note that the availability and limits of each model depend on your subscription and the access granted by OpenAI."
msgstr ""

